{{Quote|Creates barriers for defense and can trap enemies.|Shop}}
'''Creation''' (formerly known as [[Barrier]]) is a {{Legendary}} [[Natural]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|1,400,000}} or {{Robux|1,750}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Creation grants the user the ability to generate and manipulate structures. This includes both defensive constructs and offensive formations, such as buildings and skylines, which strike enemies out of thin platforms. The user can also shape a dark substance into functional constructs such as giant swords, a functional cannon, aerial platforms, or even a usable hand.

