==Overview==
<tabber>
Pros=
{{Overview|Pros
|'''General'''
* Good mobility.
* Large [[Area of Effect|AoE]].
* Relatively high damage.

|{{Ability|TAP}}
* Can block projectiles from [[guns]] or other attacks.

|{{Ability|Z}}
* Decent damage.
* Good mobility.
* Long stun.
* Great combo potential.
* Screen shake can be confusing for enemies.

|{{Ability|X}}
* Easy to toss enemies into the ocean, or away from the user.
* Long stun. 

|{{Ability|C}}
* Huge AoE.
* Good stun.
* Disables the target's movement.

|{{Ability|V}}
* [[Instinct/Break|Breaks Instinct]].
* Can confuse enemies, giving time to run away.
* Huge [[Area of Effect|AoE]].

|{{Ability|F}}
* Great for replenishing [[energy]] and mobility.
}}

|-|Cons=
{{Overview|Cons
|'''General'''
* Build mode is rather difficult to use on mobile and controller, and takes a long time to initiate.
* Most of its attacks can be dodged with [[Instinct]].

|{{Ability|TAP}}
* Cannot block moves that penetrate objects.
* Cannot move while holding.

|{{Ability|Z}}
* Single target.
* Small hitbox.

|{{Ability|X}}
* Long windup.
* Very difficult to hit a constantly moving target.

|{{Ability|C}}
* Obscures vision in small areas.

|{{Ability|V}}
* Can be dodged.
* Long windup.
* Repels attacks from allies and enemies alike.

|{{Ability|F}}
* Cannot build near NPCs, player spawns, or boats.
* Pieces can be easily broken by destructive moves.
}}
</tabber>

