==Trivia==
* Creation was reworked in [[Updates/26|Update 26]], renaming the fruit from Barrier to Creation and adding a TAP ability, alongside changing the prices.
* Creation's {{Ability|Z}} move shakes the opponent's screen, even with Screen Shake off.
* If the user leaves the server, all their creations will vanish.
* Creation's held M1 cannot be used on mobile normally. Instead, there is an alternative button located above {{Ability|Z}} that functions just the same as tapping, although resembles an activation of a move instead.
* During the Halloween Event 2026, burglar Bery and burglar Bert ride a creation-styled car.

